After preparing, we need to activate origin node and destination node (activate_origin_node, activate_destination_node). These require candidate_prepared, candidate_task_profile_linked, origin_availability_node_linked (we have), and not origin_node_ready, not origin_node_occupied. Initially nodes are not ready/occupied. So we can activate.

