Now we need to assemble transport leg. There are multiple assemble actions; we need to pick one that matches the loading states we want. For loading_container_onto_leg we need transport_leg_assembled and transport_leg_loading_authorized. The leg assembled can be any of the assemble actions; they all produce transport_leg_assembled and link origin/destination nodes, and possibly set origin_leg_loaded or destination_leg_loaded depending on action.

We need to later load container onto leg, which requires transport_leg_assembled and transport_leg_loading_authorized. It does not care about origin_leg_loaded or destination_leg_loaded. However stage_schedule_candidate requires not origin_leg_loaded (i.e., origin leg not loaded). So we should avoid actions that set origin_leg_loaded true. So we should use an assemble action that does NOT set origin_leg_loaded. Looking at assemble actions:

