We have one dispatch slot available initially (dispatch_slot_alpha). After each dispatch, the slot becomes available again (effect). So we can reuse same slot for all three dispatches sequentially.

We also need vehicles: we have three vehicles (alpha, beta, gamma). We can assign different vehicles to each dispatch to avoid conflict, but we could also reuse same vehicle after it becomes available again after dispatch (effect vehicle_available). However note that after dispatch, the vehicle becomes available again (effect). So we could use same vehicle for all three, but we need to allocate vehicle before each dispatch (requires vehicle_available). After dispatch, vehicle_available becomes true again, so we can reuse.

